{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1783220507216,"sessionID":"ses_0cfc84f6effeVOfvGIhOVWtGtm","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_01_b6NNZgPcsKbmbXNojsTn0935","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"runs/pc-lib-3456/elfutils/2026-07-05T02-46-28-603Z/blocks/function_summary.json","content":"{
  "summary": "elfutils 是 GNU 工具链的核心组件，提供一组 C 语言共享库和命令行工具，用于解析、创建、修改和校验 ELF（Executable and Linkable Format）目标文件及 DWARF 调试信息。面向系统工具开发者、调试器/性能分析工具作者和编译器后端工程师，被 systemtap、perf、LTrace、pahole 等数百个 Linux 生态工具链接依赖。",
  "categories": [
    {
      "name": "ELF 文件读写与操作",
      "description": "提供底层 libelf 库，支持 ELF 文件的创建、读取、修改和写入，包括节（section）、段（segment）、符号表、重定位表等全部 ELF 数据结构的访问与更新，支持 32/64 位、大小端转换、压缩节等。",
      "evidence": ["libelf/libelf.h", "libelf/elf_begin.c", "libelf/elf_update.c", "libelf/gelf.h"]
    },
    {
      "name": "DWARF 调试信息解析",
      "description": "通过 libdw 库提供 DWARF 调试信息的完整访问接口，包括编译单元(DIE)树遍历、行号表、调用帧信息(CFI)、宏信息、地址范围等标准 DWARF 段数据的解析与查询。",
      "evidence": ["libdw/libdw.h", "libdw/dwarf_begin.c", "libdw/dwarf_getattrs.c", "libdw/dwarf_getcfi.c"]
    },
    {
      "name": "高层 DWARF 与 ELF 整合（libdwfl）",
      "description": "libdwfl 库将 libelf 和 libdw 整合提供高层接口，自动从运行中进程、core dump、内核模块或独立 ELF 文件中加载模块并关联 DWARF 信息，支持符号地址查找、源码行号定位、栈回溯（unwinding）等功能。",
      "evidence": ["libdwfl/libdwfl.h", "libdwfl/dwfl_module_getdwarf.c", "libdwfl/linux-pid-attach.c", "libdwfl/core-file.c"]
    },
    {
      "name": "ELF 汇编器（libasm）",
      "description": "通过 libasm 库提供程序化生成 ELF 文件的能力，支持创建节、符号、重定位等，可用于编译器后端或二进制重写工具。",
      "evidence": ["libasm/libasm.h", "libasm/asm_newscn.c", "libasm/asm_addsym.c"]
    },
    {
      "name": "命令行工具集",
      "description": "提供 eu-readelf（ELF 信息查看）、eu-strip（符号剥离）、eu-nm（符号列表）、eu-objdump（反汇编）、eu-stack（栈回溯）、eu-unstrip（符号还原）、eu-elflint（ELF 合规校验）、eu-strings（字符串提取）、eu-size（段大小查看）等十余个基于上述库构建的实用工具，功能对标 binutils 的对应工具。",
      "evidence": ["src/readelf.c", "src/strip.c", "src/nm.c", "src/objdump.c", "src/stack.c", "src/unstrip.c", "src/elflint.c", "src/strings.c", "src/size.c"]
    },
    {
      "name": "Debuginfod 调试信息按需分发",
      "description": "提供 debuginfod 服务器和客户端库(libdebuginfod)，实现基于 HTTP 的 build-id 调试信息自动发现和按需下载，支持 debuginfo、可执行文件和源码的透明获取，免去手动安装 debuginfo 包的繁琐。",
      "evidence": ["debuginfod/debuginfod.cxx", "debuginfod/debuginfod-client.c", "debuginfod/debuginfod-find.c"]
    },
    {
      "name": "多架构后端支持",
      "description": "通过 backends/ 下的可插拔模块提供 30+ CPU 架构的后端支持（x86_64/i386/aarch64/arm/riscv/ppc/s390/mips/loongarch 等），每种架构有独立的寄存器描述、重定位类型定义、CFI 回退规则、core note 解析和返回值约定。",
      "evidence": ["backends/x86_64_init.c", "backends/aarch64_init.c", "backends/riscv_init.c", "backends/common-reloc.c"]
    }
  ],
  "domain": "系统工具/二进制调试",
  "target_users": "调试器开发者、性能分析工具作者、编译器后端工程师、系统工具维护者",
  "ecosystem": "cpp"
}
"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/yt/task/pc-lib-analysis/runs/pc-lib-3456/elfutils/2026-07-05T02-46-28-603Z/blocks/function_summary.json","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"runs/pc-lib-3456/elfutils/2026-07-05T02-46-28-603Z/blocks/function_summary.json","time":{"start":1783220507205,"end":1783220507215}},"id":"prt_f303953b3001ssUhAffxEyEeKU","sessionID":"ses_0cfc84f6effeVOfvGIhOVWtGtm","messageID":"msg_f303943ca001uFSNcGGtL87aHX"}}

